  "category": "Birthday",
  "experienceTime": "3 min",
  "description": "Four rooms in one gift. It opens by asking if it's their birthday, then a wall of little characters gathers and starts dancing, then an envelope pulls out a letter with a candle to blow out and your wishes inside, and it ends on a scroll of cakes — one for every year — with photos, chocolates and letters from everyone.",
